<p>You reach out with shadowy vines toward your target, pulling it to you and silencing it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns and dazing it for 2 turns.</p><p>The chance to hit improves with your Accuracy.</p>